<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Tatung Jan-Sept net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Tatung Jan-Sept net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>		     (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     31,046 vs 29,600</p>
<p>    Net profit		    5,346 vs  5,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Tatung Co Ltd is one of Taiwan's biggest electric appliance makers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
